  "details": "Me and my friend keep continuing to have this re-occurring bug in VRChat; this occurs on \"Bus to Nowhere\", but not exclusively this world. This progressive lag bug is currently known to affect both the Steam desktop client, and SteamVR client of VRChat. Over time, the master (user in the instance the longest) of the world is affected by the bug that gets progressively worse until they rejoin the world, passing it onto the next master.\n\nI am uncertain if it's a client issue, a networking issue regarding instance masters, or a Udon issue. Seems to be easier to repro on desktop mode, but can be passed onto a SteamVR user.\n\nI have sent player logs in a support ticket, to know that the VRChat settings are optimal, the FPS is low, and my hardware isn't overwhelmed. \n\nVideo:\n\nhttps://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/337672341041446912/1069102067827875850\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/337672341041446912/1069102066896748574/lag.mp4",
